              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 7"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.407,
            0.1,
            0.591,
            0.124
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "SUMMARY"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.134,
            0.823,
            0.191
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We came across large numbers — lakhs, crores and arabs; millions and billions. We learnt how to read and write these numbers in the Indian and American/International naming systems."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.192,
            0.622,
            0.21
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 1 lakh is 1 followed by 5 zeroes: 1,00,000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.211,
            0.655,
            0.229
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 1 crore is 1 followed by 7 zeroes: 1,00,00,000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.23,
            0.822,
            0.266
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) 1 million is 1 followed by 6 zeroes: 1,000,000 (which is also ten lakhs)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.268,
            0.822,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) 1 arab is 1 followed by 9 zeroes: 1,000,000,000 (which is also 100 crore or 1 billion)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.306,
            0.824,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We generally round up or round down large numbers. Many times it is enough just to know roughly how big or small something is."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.346,
            0.824,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To get a sense of large numbers or quantities, we can check how many times bigger they are compared to numbers or quantities that are more familiar."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.402,
            0.822,
            0.44
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We saw how to factorise numbers and regroup them to make multiplications simpler."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.441,
            0.823,
            0.479
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We carried out interesting thought experiments such as  — “Would one be able to watch 1000 movies in a year?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.938,
            0.186,
            0.954
          ],
          "content": [
